    </ingestible>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>PlantFoodRaw</li>
    </thingCategories>
  </ThingDef>

  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Cistrel</defName>
    <label>cistrel</label>
    <description>A tight rosette of stiff waxy leaves forming a cup at chest height, holding clear standing water you can see into — the only water on this map that is not black. Outer leaves rust-red, inner pale. The only safe water in the Fever Wood, where people and tame animals drink.</description>
