  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Maulith</defName>
    <label>maulith</label>
    <description>A crossbeam of stiff branches carrying a dense curtain of flat ribbon-leaves that falls to the walkway below, so the plant is a room with walls. Leaves olive above, silver-backed and always moving slightly. The concealment plant of the crown, and the boughway's privacy screen. Ribbon-leaf is cordage.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>55</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0.5</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <graphicData>
