  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Verrow</defName>
    <label>verrow</label>
    <description>Few fronds, held high and thin, with heavy dull-skinned gourds hanging well below them on long stalks — the fruit is the visual mass, not the leaves. The crown's staple food, reachable from a boughway without climbing. Free calories that draw the crown's grazers, and then the things that wait for grazers.</description>
