  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Nubrith</defName>
    <label>nubrith</label>
    <description>A low leathery dome on a squat stalk, glowing a steady warm amber downward onto the deck. The only natural light in the crown — deliberately warm, sitting beside the Wildsteam's steam-lamp gold rather than fighting it. A leaf that glows, not a mushroom.</description>
