  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Sodderel</defName>
    <label>sodderel</label>
    <description>A lopsided spar of a tree, half its limbs already dead and black with water, leaning permanently toward the pool. Living growth only on the high side. It looks like a wreck and is not one — this is the biome's ordinary construction wood, since the towers cannot be felled and varnoth is lethal to reach. It reads as naturally half-dead, not diseased.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>70</MaxHitPoints>
      <Flammability>0.5</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Plant/RM_Sodderel/RM_Sodderel_a</texPath>
