  </ThingDef>

  <!-- ===================== THE GROUND — 3 plants, thinness is the point ===================== -->

  <ThingDef ParentName="PlantBase">
    <defName>RM_Skimmel</defName>
    <label>skimmel</label>
    <description>A continuous pale-green film lying perfectly flat over the mud, indistinguishable from firm ground until it is stepped on. Its only tell is that it is too even — no texture, no debris, and it never grows on ground that is actually solid. Disguises the sink-mud beneath it. ⚠️ Deliberately deceptive to the eye — do not "fix" this into looking safer or less like ground.</description>
